# SARA evaluator API

This file is the evaluator-facing contract. The required scope and output below
are fixed; add factual inputs, internal variables, and section subscopes without
renaming or removing them.

- Requirement ID `SARA-TOTAL-TAX`: scope `TotalTax`, output `total_tax`.

> Module Api
> Using Definitions as W
> Using Section1 as S1
> Using Section2 as S2
> Using Section63 as S63
> Using Section68 as S68
> Using Section151 as S151
> Using Section152 as S152
> Using Section3301 as S3301
> Using Section3306 as S3306
> Using Section7703 as S7703

```catala-metadata
declaration scope TotalTax:
  input taxable_income content money
  input filing_status content S1.FilingStatus
  input unemployment_tax content money
  section_1 scope S1.TotalTax
  output income_tax content money
  output total_tax content money
```

```catala
scope TotalTax:
  definition section_1.taxable_income equals taxable_income
  definition section_1.filing_status equals filing_status
  definition section_1.unemployment_tax equals unemployment_tax
  definition income_tax equals section_1.income_tax
  definition total_tax equals section_1.total_tax
```
